<title>SWITZERLAND: Ciba completes sale of Mettler.</title>
<headline>Ciba completes sale of Mettler.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ciba-Geigy AG said it had completed the previously announced sale of scales and weighing systems unit mettler Toledo to private U.S. investment group AEA Investors Inc.  </p>
<p>&quot;The agreed sale of Mettler Toledo...was completed yesterday following closure of the financial transaction and receipt of official approvals,&quot; a Ciba statement said.</p>
<p>Ciba announced the sale of Mettler to AEA on April 2 as part of concentrating on core pharmaceutical and agricultural businesses ahead of the planned merger with Swiss rival Sandoz AG to form Novartis.</p>
<p>The price was announced at the time as 919 million Swiss francs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
